title: Political Rally
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
view-if: rally_timer <= 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; rally_timer = 6
card-image: img/protest.jpg
go-to: main_rally; online_right_disrupt if online_right_strength > 250 and not online_right_banned

@online_right_disrupt

Online-right accounts have organized a coordinated harassment and disruption campaign against our event - doxxing organizers, flooding venue contact lines with threats, and, in some cases, mobilizing counter-protesters to show up in person.

- @platform_response: Work with the venue and platforms to shut down the harassment campaign.
- @canvass_protect: Mobilize the canvass network to provide in-person safety support.
- @both_protect: Do both.
- @cancel: Cancel the rally rather than risk it.

@platform_response
choose-if: federal_agencies_loyalty >= 0.5
unavailable-subtitle: Without cooperative platforms or law enforcement, there isn't much leverage here.
on-arrival: platform_success = federal_agencies_loyalty*2 - online_right_militancy*online_right_strength/100;
go-to: platform_win if platform_success >= 0; platform_lose if platform_success < 0

@platform_win
go-to: main_rally

Platform moderation and a cooperative venue succeeded in getting ahead of the harassment campaign. The rally goes ahead as planned.

@platform_lose
on-arrival: constitutional_crisis_progress += 1; non_college_white_gop += 3;

The harassment campaign overwhelmed the response. Several organizers report being doxxed, and turnout suffers.

@canvass_protect
on-arrival: canvass_success = canvass_strength*canvass_militancy - online_right_strength*online_right_militancy/50;
go-to: canvass_win if canvass_success >= 0; canvass_lose if canvass_success < 0

@canvass_win
go-to: main_rally

Our own organizing infrastructure was enough to keep the event secure and on schedule.

@canvass_lose
on-arrival: non_college_white_gop += 3; canvass_strength -= 2;

Despite our efforts, the disruption campaign takes a toll - a handful of volunteers say they don't want to do this again.

@both_protect
choose-if: federal_agencies_loyalty >= 0.5
unavailable-subtitle: Without cooperative platforms or law enforcement, there isn't much added value here.
on-arrival: combined_success = canvass_strength*canvass_militancy + federal_agencies_loyalty*2 - online_right_strength*online_right_militancy/50;
go-to: both_win if combined_success >= 0; both_lose if combined_success < 0

@both_win
go-to: main_rally

Between platform cooperation and our own canvass network, the rally goes ahead safely and on schedule.

@both_lose
on-arrival: non_college_white_gop += 3; canvass_strength -= 2; constitutional_crisis_progress += 1;

Even with both responses, the disruption campaign does real damage - to the event, and to morale.

@cancel
on-arrival: non_college_white_gop += 2;

We cancel rather than risk it. It feels like a small concession, but it is one.

@main_rally

Rallies and mass canvass launches remain a staple of movement politics, especially in the run-up to an election. What is the primary theme of this one?

- @class_struggle: Class struggle - organized labor and the working class against corporate power.
- @welfare: Concrete material gains - healthcare, housing, and a jobs guarantee.
- @democracy: Defending democracy against authoritarian drift.
- @internationalism: Opposing endless war and a militarized foreign policy.
- @jobs_program: Support the jobs guarantee!
- @local: A mix of local and national concerns tailored to this audience.
- @easy_discard

@class_struggle
on-arrival: working_class_dem += 4*(1-dissent); non_college_white_dem += 3*(1-dissent) if insurgent_strength > establishment_dem_strength; working_class_dem += 4*(1-dissent) if public_ownership_adopted > 0; insurgent_strength += 5; insurgent_dissent -= 5; suburban_dem -= 3; college_educated_dem -= 2;

Our message of class struggle appeals to the left wing of the working class, while potentially alienating some suburban and professional voters. [? if public_ownership_adopted > 0 : Our record on public ownership has assisted our messaging. ?]

@welfare
on-arrival: working_class_dem += 3*(1-dissent); working_class_dem += 3*(1-dissent) if healthcare_expansion > 0; working_class_dem += 4*(1-dissent) if healthcare_expansion > 1; establishment_dem_strength += 3; labor_left_strength += 4; establishment_dem_dissent -= 3; labor_left_dissent -= 3;

The material-gains message appeals broadly to working people whose lives have been touched by expanded benefits. [? if healthcare_expansion > 1 : Our record expanding healthcare has made this message land harder. ?]

@democracy
on-arrival: authoritarian_urgency += 1; pro_democracy += 2*(1 - dissent); working_class_dem += 4*(1-dissent) if authoritarian_urgency >= 3; college_educated_dem += 4*(1-dissent) if authoritarian_urgency >= 3; pro_democracy += 4*(1-dissent) if authoritarian_urgency >= 3;

Our speakers warn about the authoritarian drift of the opposition and the fragility of democratic norms.

[? if authoritarian_urgency < 3 : Talk of abstract democratic norms does not move people as much as more immediate material concerns - yet. ?]
[? if authoritarian_urgency >= 3 : Since we've consistently made this a theme, people are genuinely engaged by the message now. ?]

@internationalism
on-arrival: foreign_policy_restraint += 1; polarization -= 2*(1 - dissent); working_class_dem += 4*(1 - dissent) if foreign_policy_restraint >= 3; college_educated_dem += 3*(1-dissent) if foreign_policy_restraint >= 3;

Our speakers denounce endless war and the outsized influence of the defense industry on foreign policy.

[? if foreign_policy_restraint < 3 : Given the weight of conventional foreign-policy thinking, this argument is a hard sell so far. ?]
[? if foreign_policy_restraint >= 3 : Since we've consistently made this a theme, our audience is genuinely receptive now. ?]

@jobs_program
view-if: jobs_program_implemented = 1
choose-if: crisis_urgency <= 5
unavailable-subtitle: The economic crisis has largely passed, and the public is less interested in hearing about it now.
on-arrival: jobs_program += 1; working_class_dem += 6*(1-dissent); rural_dem += 3*(1-dissent); suburban_dem += 3*(1-dissent); college_educated_dem += 3*(1-dissent);

The jobs guarantee has become a genuinely popular rallying point. People are eager to work, and that's exactly what the program promises.

@local
on-arrival: working_class_dem += 3*(1-dissent); rural_dem += 1*(1-dissent); suburban_dem += 2*(1-dissent); college_educated_dem += 2*(1-dissent);

Our speakers have gauged the mood of this particular audience and are speaking directly to the issues on their minds.
